### Summary
Adds a shared helper `checkTrilTriuMatrixOverlap` that detects internal memory 
overlap in the last two dimensions of the output tensor for `triu_`/`tril_`, 
raising `RuntimeError` before silent data corruption occurs. Called from CPU, 
CUDA, and MPS kernels. Includes a thorough regression test covering 
overlapping-raise, safe-no-raise, and correctness cases. Clean, minimal, 
well-targeted fix that builds on the approach explored in #165993 and #176782.

